Why not put everything in one file?
Imagine main.py grows to around 1,500 lines.

Finding one function becomes difficult.

Instead, you know immediately where to look:

SQL problem → database.py
Maths problem → poisson.py
Simulation problem → montecarlo.py
Menu problem → main.py
That's exactly why larger programs are split into modules.

